sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Supervisor and app
    participant B as Task B
    participant A as Task A
    participant U as User
    activate S
    activate B
    activate A
    A->>S: User approval required
    deactivate A
    Note over A: Waiting
    S->>U: Present specific request
    U->>A: Decision on the original child thread
    activate A
    Note over A: Resume on the same thread
    Note over S,B: Conversation and independent work continue
    deactivate A
    deactivate B
    deactivate S
